# Consolidate ALL traffic onto the canonical domain: https://reacnspire.com
# 301-redirect the old kendrareacconsultant.com domain (apex + www) so Google
# treats reacnspire.com as the one true site and all link equity flows here.
# The "!" forces the redirect even when the path exists.

https://kendrareacconsultant.com/*      https://reacnspire.com/:splat   301!
http://kendrareacconsultant.com/*        https://reacnspire.com/:splat   301!
https://www.kendrareacconsultant.com/*   https://reacnspire.com/:splat   301!
http://www.kendrareacconsultant.com/*    https://reacnspire.com/:splat   301!
